      "excerpts": [
        "Ontario is the most populous of the 13 provinces and territories of Canada, accounting for nearly 40 percent of all Canadians.",
        "Located in east-central Canada, it is the second-largest province in total area, and the fourth-largest when the territories of the Northwest Territories and Nunavut are included.",
